// rule-evidence: docs/design/vips/0007-match.md#decision
// VIP-7: the retained fixed checks cover every public effect/… module. Effect
// 4.1.1 adds effect/jose, whose JoseError is a tagged error with the guard
// isJoseError, so the inventory holds 40 fixed checks, 34 of them tagged errors.
// Each tagged pattern agrees with its module's guard and extracts [s]; a bare
// _tag copy matches none. The six Option, Exit and Result variants extract
// their fields.
// expect-result: {"tagged":34,"variants":6,"misses":[]}
